  "limitations": [
    "Combined 65-turn behavior suite contains labelled known regressions and newly authored follow-ups; it is not blind accuracy.",
    "Effective intent, raw learned modelIntent, deterministic exact-relation fallback and pending-confirmation routes are counted separately.",
    "v1 48-question regression matches 40 labels under the v2 head; changing fitting data did not establish an across-the-board classifier gain.",
    "Only 25/65 complete follow-up behaviors pass all source/entity/URL checks. Longer paraphrases, setup subtopics, documentation and specialized qualifiers remain incomplete.",
    "Validation still selected zero score/margin thresholds; ranking scores do not provide calibrated uncertainty.",
    "The first v2 run used stricter test-harness checks that incorrectly ignored visible research citation URLs and pending candidates; the integrated checker fixes are documented without modifying frozen expectations."
  ]
